[[Azure Shadow]]s are translucent, spirit-like creatures that reside in the [[Southern Shiverpeaks]].  They usually [[popup]] out of nowhere, but are sometimes already visible.  They are notorious for appearing in groups of 3 or more and casting [[Signet of Judgment]] almost immediately after engaging in battle - a headache for runners without some protection against [[knockdown]].

